			"gloss": "<i>Beth</i>, the second letter of the Alphabet. Its sound lies betwen p (<cite ref=\"Q00000\"><he>פ</he></cite>) and v (<cite ref=\"F00000\"><he>ו</he></cite>), whence its interchange with either, e.g. <cite ref=\"E00759\"><he>הפקר</he></cite> and <cite ref=\"E00049\"><he>הבקר</he></cite>; <cite ref=\"B00005\"><he>בָּא</he></cite> (<cite ref=\"A00017\"><he>אַבָּא</he></cite>) and <cite ref=\"F00003\"><he>וָוא</he></cite>.—<cite ref=\"B00000\"><he>ב</he></cite> also interchanges with <cite ref=\"M00000\"><he>מ</he></cite>, as <cite ref=\"B00263\"><he>בולטיתא</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"M01540\"><he>מלטיתא</he></cite>; cmp. b. h. <cite ref=\"M01533\"><he>מָלַט</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"Q00997\"><he>פָּלַט</he></cite>.",
